                        "entry_id": "b1ae4c3a-663f-3236-a695-bf86a4ed1c0d",
                        "glosses": [
                            "An unexpected situation, detail or circumstance, often unpleasant, serving as a punchline or clincher."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "colloquial"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "490e396f-0ac1-4a62-85a0-2d789a885e81",
                                "sense_id": "7948f3ac-7744-3974-9a73-83d57319988c",
                                "text": "John wants to climb the wall, but the kicker is that it is thirty feet tall."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4dd624a5-58fb-4e0c-bdcf-717b7e18685e",
                                "sense_id": "7948f3ac-7744-3974-9a73-83d57319988c",
                                "text": "Tuition is free; the kicker is that mandatory room and board costs twice as much as at other colleges."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4ae83307-2b04-44d2-a6fe-064643f5a547",
                                "sense_id": "7948f3ac-7744-3974-9a73-83d57319988c",
                                "text": "If the coffee is currently being spilled, I can't unspill it. And here's the kicker. You can't change the future, because it hasn't happened yet."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "6c194745-17d1-49aa-b4c0-0f47e00c1c1e",
                                "sense_id": "7948f3ac-7744-3974-9a73-83d57319988c",
                                "text": "They want me gone, wait for the kicker / Bury me now and I only get bigger"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "6f0db7dc-7191-352c-87e4-2209b18883ab",
                        "entry_id": "b1ae4c3a-663f-3236-a695-bf86a4ed1c0d",
                        "glosses": [
                            "An enticement for investors, e.g. warranty added to the investment contract."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "34aa52f1-ec56-32a8-a3cf-8e458a96bb86",
                        "entry_id": "b1ae4c3a-663f-3236-a695-bf86a4ed1c0d",
                        "glosses": [
                            "An unpaired card which is part of a pair, two pair, or three of a kind poker hand."
